===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₁su-|*bʰer-}}
From {{bor|en|NL.|euphoria}}, from {{der|en|grc|εὐφορίᾱ}}, from {{m|grc|εὔφορος||bearing well}}, from {{m|grc|εὐ-|t=well}} + {{m|grc|φέρω|t=to bear}}.

