===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# An [[excited]] state of [[joy]]; a feeling of intense [[happiness]].
#: {{ux|en|The runner was in (a state of) absolute '''euphoria''' after winning his first marathon.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Zachary Pottle|title=Galaxy Gas: Flavored Whipped Cream Charger Or Dangerous Drug?|magazine=AddictionCenter|url=https://www.addictioncenter.com/community/galaxy-gas/|date=2024-09-14|passage=The effects caused by inhaling nitrous oxide gas, such as lightheadedness and '''euphoria''', can be felt within seconds.}}
# {{lb|en|LGBT}} {{ellipsis of|en|gender euphoria}}.

